sequenceDiagram
    participant SCH as Scheduler
    participant ADV as Advisory orchestrator
    participant RAG as Retrieval and wiki
    participant IND as Indicator library
    participant STR as Strategist (capable model)
    participant VO as Voting orchestrator
    participant TOOL as Verification tool
    participant MV as Micro-validator (small model)
    participant POL as Consensus policy
    participant DB as Database

    SCH->>ADV: advise(ticker)
    ADV->>RAG: retrieve context and wiki page
    RAG-->>ADV: cited chunks, curated page
    ADV->>IND: quantitative summary
    IND-->>ADV: indicators
    ADV->>STR: context bundle
    STR-->>ADV: draft: stance, thesis, typed claims
    ADV->>DB: persist draft and claims
    loop for each checkable claim
        ADV->>VO: verify(claim)
        VO->>TOOL: run(payload)
        TOOL-->>VO: ToolResult (cached for all samples)
        loop until margin k reached or cap N_max
            VO->>MV: claim + ToolResult only
            MV-->>VO: verdict + rationale
            VO->>VO: red-flag screen (RF1, RF2)
            VO->>DB: persist ValidatorVote
        end
        VO-->>ADV: verdict + vote trail
    end
    ADV->>POL: decide(claims)
    POL-->>ADV: disposition, confidence
    ADV->>DB: persist final recommendation and costs
    ADV-->>SCH: gated recommendation
